PROJECT TITLE: 
FlashQuizz

PROBLEM STAEMENT:
      As scholars, people expect a lot from us, and because of this, we are often given more advanced lessons and activities.
With the amount of information we need to learn, many students struggle to keep up with their lessons and prepare for assessments.
Because of this, students tend to rely on apps that generate reviewers for them since they dont want to waste time making their
own, however some apps are pretty slow, and even cost money, so not everyone has access to it. 

PROJECT OBJECTIVES:
• To provide students with an easier and faster way to create study materials.
• To use AI to generate flashcards and quiz questions from provided learning materials.
• To allow students to study using different types of quizzes and flashcards.
• To help students review their lessons and monitor their quiz performance.
• To reduce the time and effort needed to manually create reviewers. 

PLANNED FEATURES:
File Upload: Upload PDFs, pictures, or plain text as study sources.
AI-Generated Flashcards: Automatically creates question-and-answer flashcards from the uploaded materials.
AI-Generated Quizzes: Creates quizzes based on the provided sources.
Multiple Quiz Types: Can generate multiple-choice, true/false, identification, and other question types.
Regenerate Questions: Allows users to create another set of questions from the same source.
Study Mode: Lets students review generated flashcards and answer questions.
Score Tracking: Records quiz scores so students can see their progress.
Save Study Sets: Allows users to save generated flashcards and quizzes for later use. 

PLANNED INPUTS AND OUTPUTS:
->INPUTS:
• PDF File/s         
• Plain Text
• Picture
• Settings, such as number and type of questions 

->OUTPUTS:
• Generated Flashcards
• Generated Quizz questions
• Quiz answers/results
• Quiz scores 

